'''Honey''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Torrhus Canyon}}. She introduces the player to the Tree Protection Agency and [[Pots of Honeycomb]].

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
!Condition
!Dialogue
|-
| class="ct" | First Interaction
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &6Honey&f: Psst, have you heard of the &cTree Protection Agency&f?
&eSelect an option: &a[Yes] &c[No] 
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Selecting {{Rmt|&c[No]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &6Honey&f: Well, they're an evil group that is all about protecting the &aTrees&f!
&e[NPC] &6Honey&f: Any poor tree with a &cTree Protection Order &fon it, you simply can't cut!
&e[NPC] &6Honey&f: Though, while we can't cut them, what we can do is deface them a little...
&eSelect an option: &c[Deface them?!] 
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Selecting {{Rmt|&a[Yes]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &6Honey&f: Well I'm gonna tell you anyways, because you don't look like someone who knows a lot.
&e[NPC] &6Honey&f: So, about the &cTree Protection Agency&f...
&e[NPC] &6Honey&f: Well, they're an evil group that is all about protecting the &aTrees&f!
&e[NPC] &6Honey&f: Any poor tree with a &cTree Protection Order &fon it, you simply can't cut!
&e[NPC] &6Honey&f: Though, while we can't cut them, what we can do is deface them a little...
&eSelect an option: &c[Deface them?!] 
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Selecting {{Rmt|&c[Deface them?!]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &6Honey&f: Yeah, if you progress through the &aHoneycomb Collection&f, you'll notice that there's a &aFun-Sized Pot of Honeycomb&f.
&e[NPC] &6Honey&f: If you make one of those, you can go right up to a &cProtected Tree &fand smear &6Honeycomb &fall over it!
&e[NPC] &6Honey&f: Then, if you check back after a while, a &a Critter &fwill have come along and started eating all the &6Honeycomb&f!
&e[NPC] &6Honey&f: Eh, why don't I just show you a visual?
}}
|}

